  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Aura</strong> moderate divination, abjuration, illusion; <strong>CL</strong> 8th; <strong>Cost</strong> 29,600 GP<br>\n<strong>Slot</strong> none <strong>Weight</strong> 5 lbs.<br>\n<strong>Description</strong><br>\nThis staff is made from a brass-like shadow metal, and topped with an eye cast from the same metal.</p>\n<p>The staff allows use of the following spells:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>dark whispers (1 charge)</li>\n<li>track ship (1 charge)</li>\n<li>riversight (all water inside the docks, rather than just a river, 2 charges)</li>\n<li>dimensional anchor (2 charges)</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Construction Requirements</strong><br>\n14,800 gp; Craft Staff, dark whispers, dimensional anchor, riversight, track ship</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/seraph-magic-items#toc22\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
